  "description": "<p>This inspirational area rug combines faith-inspired design with everyday functionality. Featuring a floral motif, this traditional rug offers a welcoming accent for various home settings. It is designed to enhance both spiritual and interior atmospheres, making it a versatile addition to your living space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design for a traditional aesthetic.</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name, family name, or special message.</li>\n<li>Made with soft polyester fabric for comfort.</li>\n<li>Equipped with an anti-slip backing for enhanced safety.</li>\n<li>Suitable for various rooms, including living rooms, bedrooms, and offices.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form Type</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Entryways, Bedrooms, Living Rooms, Offices, Gamer Rooms, Reading Nooks, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance Level</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Personalized with Name or Text</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith, Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft polyester fabric</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning or machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Attributes</td>\n<td>Wrinkle-resistant, Fade-resistant, Long-lasting</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, and offices, adding a touch of inspiration and comfort. It also serves as a meaningful piece for church decor or a dedicated meditation corner.</p>",
